WEBVTT

NOTE Man with a Movie Camera (1929) - Riah TV captions

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:13.379
[Russian title cards,
translated] THE MAN WITH A MOVIE
CAMERA. A record on film in 6
reels. Produced by VUFKU, 1929.

00:00:13.389 --> 00:00:17.490
(An excerpt from a cameraman's
diary)

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:30.490
ATTENTION, VIEWERS: This film is
an experiment in the cinematic
communication of visible events.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:37.490
Without the help of intertitles
(a film without intertitles)

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.490
Without the help of a script
(a film without a script)

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:52.490
Without the help of a theater (a
film without sets, actors, etc.)

00:00:52.500 --> 00:01:07.805
This experimental work aims at
creating a truly international,
absolute language of cinema,
based on its complete separation

00:01:07.815 --> 00:01:13.240
from the language of theater and
literature.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:18.240
Author and supervisor of
the experiment: Dziga Vertov

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:21.490
Chief cameraman: M. Kaufman

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:26.750
Editing assistant: E. Svilova

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:30.950
[music]

01:06:37.750 --> 01:06:40.250
THE END
